<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Comparison of linguistic feature controllability between models with and without the Utterance Length (<math id="A2.F7.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>) feature. The left subplot (QWEN-DPO) represents the model trained with <math id="A2.F7.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>; the right subplot (QWEN-DPO-<math id="A2.F7.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>) represents the model trained without <math id="A2.F7.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
