<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Performance comparison of language proficiency-controlled models with and without the Utterance Length feature. The ‘- <math id="A3.T6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{L}</annotation></semantics></math>‘ rows represent models trained on data where the Utterance Length feature has been removed.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
