<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Comparison of Language Difficulty Evaluation between the Prompt-Based Method and the QWEN-DPO Model using CEFR-SP. Columns A1–C2 represent CEFR levels for the Prompt-Based method, while <math id="A6.T7.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{0.0,0.2,\dots,1.0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{0.0,0.2,\dots,1.0\}</annotation></semantics></math> indicates difficulty levels for the QWEN-DPO model. </figcaption>
</figure>
